		{"id":"question","type":"text","text":"# World modeling in DINO feature space\nCan a feature-space world model represent several futures?","x":430,"y":-420,"width":1240,"height":130,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"recipe","type":"text","text":"**Shared recipe**\nFrozen visual encoder → future features → perception head","x":600,"y":-210,"width":900,"height":100},
		{"id":"legend","type":"text","text":"**Read → through time; ↓ by representation**\nOrange: point prediction · Green: stochastic generation\nBlue “cites” arrows: verified references, pointing to the cited paper. Other arrows: labeled conceptual/benchmark links.","x":-370,"y":-190,"width":650,"height":160},
