		{"id":"compressed-label","type":"text","text":"## Compressed features\nAn extra bottleneck before forecasting.","x":-370,"y":190,"width":280,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"full-label","type":"text","text":"## Full features\nForecast directly in the encoder’s space.","x":-370,"y":740,"width":280,"height":150,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"foresight","type":"text","text":"### DINO-Foresight [💻](https://github.com/Sta8is/DINO-Foresight) [📦](https://huggingface.co/Sta8is/DINO-Foresight)\n[2024 · DINO-Foresight](https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.11673)","x":0,"y":200,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"foresight-rep","type":"text","text":"Multi-layer DINO → **PCA**","x":30,"y":335,"width":370,"height":65},
		{"id":"foresight-pred","type":"text","text":"**Masked transformer**\nDeterministic regression","x":30,"y":450,"width":370,"height":70,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"foresight-out","type":"text","text":"One forecast in PCA space","x":30,"y":560,"width":370,"height":50},
		{"id":"dino","type":"text","text":"### DINO-world\n[[Back to the Features - DINO as a Foundation for Video World Models|2025 · Back to the Features]]","x":570,"y":750,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"vfmf","type":"text","text":"### VFMF [💻](https://github.com/gboduljak/vfmf) [📦](https://huggingface.co/Gabrijel/vfmf)\n[[VFMF - World Modeling by Forecasting Vision Foundation Model Features|2025 · compressed feature generation]]","x":1140,"y":200,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"vfmf-rep","type":"text","text":"DINO features → **VAE**","x":1170,"y":335,"width":370,"height":65},
		{"id":"dino-rep","type":"text","text":"**Last-layer DINOv2** features","x":600,"y":885,"width":370,"height":65},
		{"id":"dino-pred","type":"text","text":"**Cross-attention predictor**\nSmooth L1 regression","x":600,"y":1000,"width":370,"height":70,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"dino-out","type":"text","text":"One feature forecast","x":600,"y":1110,"width":370,"height":50},
		{"id":"vfmf-pred","type":"text","text":"**Autoregressive flow matching**\nGenerate compressed latents","x":1170,"y":450,"width":370,"height":70,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"vfmf-out","type":"text","text":"Sample → VAE decode → features","x":1170,"y":560,"width":370,"height":50},
		{"id":"flow","type":"text","text":"### FlowWM [💻](https://github.com/facebookresearch/Flow-World-Models)\n[[Flow Matching in Feature Space for Stochastic World Modeling|2026 · direct feature generation]]","x":1710,"y":750,"width":430,"height":100,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"flow-rep","type":"text","text":"**Full pretrained features**","x":1740,"y":885,"width":370,"height":65},
		{"id":"flow-pred","type":"text","text":"**Flow matching**\nWide head + timestep scheduling","x":1740,"y":1000,"width":370,"height":70,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"flow-out","type":"text","text":"Multiple feature-space futures","x":1740,"y":1110,"width":370,"height":50},
		{"id":"bottleneck-question","type":"text","text":"### Compress to generate?\nVFMF: learn a compact space.\n\nFlowWM: adapt the generator.","x":-370,"y":430,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"mean-question","type":"text","text":"### What if the same past branches?\nA point forecast cannot express all alternatives.","x":1110,"y":930,"width":460,"height":150,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"rae","type":"text","text":"### RAE · Oct 2025 [💻](https://github.com/bytetriper/RAE) [📦](https://huggingface.co/nyu-visionx/RAE-collections)\n[[Diffusion Transformers with Representation Autoencoders|Making generation in DINO space practical]]\n\n**Semantic features can support high-quality image generation.** Adapt the architecture and training to their high dimensionality:\n\n- **Wide, shallow head:** avoid a narrow denoising bottleneck.\n- **Dimension-aware noise schedule:** adjust the noise–signal balance.\n- **Noise-augmented decoder:** handle imperfect generated latents.\n\nStrong evidence and a practical recipe—not the first feature-space generator.","x":820,"y":1850,"width":600,"height":340,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"frozen","type":"text","text":"### Frozen Forecasting\n[[Frozen Forecasting - A Unified Evaluation|Jul 2025 · Frozen Forecasting]]\n\n**Diffusion in frozen features**\n→ task-specific readouts\n\n**FlowWM benchmark baseline:**\nreimplemented with DINOv3.","x":570,"y":1300,"width":470,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"frozen-eval","type":"text","text":"### Evaluate distributions of trajectories\nCompare forecasting across backbones and tasks—not only a single predicted frame.","x":0,"y":1630,"width":430,"height":150,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"release-key","type":"text","x":1550,"y":-210,"width":640,"height":175,"text":"**Public releases · checked 18 Sep 2026**\n💻 official code · 📦 trained checkpoints\nOnly available releases get badges.\nBackbone weights and local untrained reproductions do not count."}
	],
